The Hindi etymology of Lojban is now available at:

https://www.dealloc.org/~mublin/lojban-source-words_hi

This is version 1.0 of the Hindi etymology, an attempt to reconstruct
the Hindi source words used in generating Lojban gismu.

Of the 1386 Hindi source words, 75 have not yet been reconstructed,
and 73 reconstructions are dubious. If you would like to help out,
have a look at the accompanying README, and search for "FIXIT" on the
page.

If you have trouble viewing the Indic characters on the page, you may
find some help on this page:

http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Multilingual_support_%28Indic%29

